    "title": "Deborah Nicholls appears in court, new date set for mid-June - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyson Sintas ,\n10 hours ago COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. (KKTV) - A woman convicted of murder in the deaths of her three children will be in court again in three weeks after her appearance Wednesday. Deborah Nicholls was in court Wednesday morning after the El Paso County District Court ruled that the prosecution suppressed scientific evidence contradicting its theory of arson in her trial. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
